{"id": "EUVD-2026-78232", "enisaUuid": "b9cdccb2-744c-37df-bef7-6e8a0b890187", "description": "WeKnora before 0.7.0 fails to re-validate HTTP redirect targets in the POST /api/v1/knowledge-bases/:id/knowledge/url endpoint when downloading documents from user-supplied URLs. Authenticated attackers can bypass initial SSRF validation by supplying a public URL that redirects to internal network addresses, allowing access to internal services and cloud metadata.", "datePublished": "2026-09-15T00:35:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:22:20", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora/issues/2511", "https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora", "https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora/commit/1d322c525a6197d24f07555b4b18ad33313b4328", "https://github.com/Tencent/WeKnora/blob/v0.6.2/internal/application/service/knowledge_util.go#L339-L348", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/weknora-before-0.7.0-ssrf-via-unvalidated-http-redirects"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-91750", "GHSA-hvpp-w3x6-m653"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.44, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0a9ca0ba-e43b-3b5e-beca-7637b8053661", "product": {"name": "WeKnora", "vendor": {"name": "Tencent"}}, "product_version": "0.5.2 <0.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "88b4de75-1e59-3158-bae6-a86086aac806", "vendor": {"name": "Tencent"}}], "isExploited": false}